      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Worker A 抢占领取 (epoch=1)\nStorage.claim_next_run (storage.py)\nPG: FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED\nSQLite WAL: BEGIN IMMEDIATE 排他写锁\n+ exclusive_run() 同机 OS flock 双保险",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z1_claim_a",
      "originalText": "Worker A 抢占领取 (epoch=1)\nStorage.claim_next_run (storage.py)\nPG: FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED\nSQLite WAL: BEGIN IMMEDIATE 排他写锁\n+ exclusive_run() 同机 OS flock 双保险",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
