      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Worker A 心跳续租与假死超时\nLeaseWorker.heartbeat_loop (lease.py)\n按 1/3 TTL 周期调 heartbeat_lease()\n遭遇 GC / SIGSTOP / I/O 阻塞越过 lease_until\n锁繁忙超期则保守自杀 cancel 本地推理协程",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z1_stall_a",
      "originalText": "Worker A 心跳续租与假死超时\nLeaseWorker.heartbeat_loop (lease.py)\n按 1/3 TTL 周期调 heartbeat_lease()\n遭遇 GC / SIGSTOP / I/O 阻塞越过 lease_until\n锁繁忙超期则保守自杀 cancel 本地推理协程",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
