      "text": "Worker B 接管与跨节点工作区物化\nclaim_next_run -> epoch=2, takeover_count+1\n_materialize_workspace_if_needed()\n从 workspace_archives 表解压还原目录\n(direct_workspace 严禁归档防旧快照倒灌)",
