      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "能力安全边界与提案创建幂等键 (tools.py + storage.py)\napply_proposal 永不暴露于 definitions() / _validators (根绝提示注入自我审批)\n部分唯一索引 proposals_operation(run_id, operation_id) 绑定 call_id 与参数摘要\n弥合“提案已落库、tool_calls 账本未落盘”崩溃窗口，重放自动找回原 pending 提案",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z2_cap_gate",
      "originalText": "能力安全边界与提案创建幂等键 (tools.py + storage.py)\napply_proposal 永不暴露于 definitions() / _validators (根绝提示注入自我审批)\n部分唯一索引 proposals_operation(run_id, operation_id) 绑定 call_id 与参数摘要\n弥合“提案已落库、tool_calls 账本未落盘”崩溃窗口，重放自动找回原 pending 提案",
