      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "非文件副作用动作“至多执行一次”防重放 (command / gui_action)\nbash_exec 与 computer_* 无磁盘文件哈希可事后推断，且不占文件补丁锁防阻塞读\n执行完立刻调 mark_action_proposal_executed(applied=True, execution_result)\n若在追加对话历史前崩溃，resume() 重入直接回放缓存 execution_result (绝不二次执行!)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z2_action_once",
      "originalText": "非文件副作用动作“至多执行一次”防重放 (command / gui_action)\nbash_exec 与 computer_* 无磁盘文件哈希可事后推断，且不占文件补丁锁防阻塞读\n执行完立刻调 mark_action_proposal_executed(applied=True, execution_result)\n若在追加对话历史前崩溃，resume() 重入直接回放缓存 execution_result (绝不二次执行!)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
