      "text": "多租户令牌鉴权与限流 (_GuardMiddleware · api.py)\nAGENT_LAB_TOKENS_JSON 解析 Principal(tenant_id, actor_id, roles)\n四级权限模型: operator / approver / admin / global_admin\nhmac.compare_digest 常量时间验签 + _TenantRateLimiter 60s 滑窗限流",
