      "originalText": "异人复核门控 (4-Eyes Separation · api.py)\nPOST /api/runs/{run_id}/proposals/{proposal_id}\n要求 approver / admin 角色；当 AGENT_LAB_REQUIRE_DISTINCT_APPROVER=1:\n强制校验 principal.actor_id != run.metadata['created_by'] (否则 403 拒绝自审)",
