      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "宿主目录边界门卫与产物 CSP 沙箱 (api.py + permissions.py)\n_can_use_direct_workspace: 开启鉴权后仅 global_admin 或 local+admin\n可挂载 local_cwd / workspace_path (外部租户强制隔离于临时沙箱与私有记忆域)\n产物端点禁 .html/.svg 并强制下发 CSP: default-src 'none' 防同源 XSS",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z3_direct_ws",
      "originalText": "宿主目录边界门卫与产物 CSP 沙箱 (api.py + permissions.py)\n_can_use_direct_workspace: 开启鉴权后仅 global_admin 或 local+admin\n可挂载 local_cwd / workspace_path (外部租户强制隔离于临时沙箱与私有记忆域)\n产物端点禁 .html/.svg 并强制下发 CSP: default-src 'none' 防同源 XSS",
