      "locked": false,
      "text": "终态资源 GC 与 direct_workspace 绝对豁免 (storage.py)\nStorage.gc_expired_resources(retention_seconds=86400)\n自动回收超期终态任务的托管 workspaces/<id>、Git worktree、归档与陈旧锁\n安全铁律: 凡 metadata['direct_workspace']==True 无条件豁免目录删除，仅清锁与过期截图!",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z3_gc_exempt",
      "originalText": "终态资源 GC 与 direct_workspace 绝对豁免 (storage.py)\nStorage.gc_expired_resources(retention_seconds=86400)\n自动回收超期终态任务的托管 workspaces/<id>、Git worktree、归档与陈旧锁\n安全铁律: 凡 metadata['direct_workspace']==True 无条件豁免目录删除，仅清锁与过期截图!",
