      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "W3C Trace Context 全链路透传 (observability.py)\n_parse_trace_input 严格校验 00-<32hex>-<16hex>-01 (拒 version=ff 与全零 ID)\n非法控制字符输入统一做 SHA-256[:32] 定长化，彻底阻断日志伪造注入\nHTTP traceparent -> ContextVar -> runs.metadata -> LeaseWorker -> X-Trace-Id",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z4_trace",
      "originalText": "W3C Trace Context 全链路透传 (observability.py)\n_parse_trace_input 严格校验 00-<32hex>-<16hex>-01 (拒 version=ff 与全零 ID)\n非法控制字符输入统一做 SHA-256[:32] 定长化，彻底阻断日志伪造注入\nHTTP traceparent -> ContextVar -> runs.metadata -> LeaseWorker -> X-Trace-Id",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
