      "versionNonce": 1112726939,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "零信任递归凭据脱敏与安全错误摘要 (observability.py)\nredact_secrets(): 递归屏蔽 key/token/secret/authorization/password/credential\n正则擦除字符串内嵌 Bearer 令牌与 DSN 连接串密码 (://user:[REDACTED]@host)\nsanitize_error_detail(): 剥离原始异常隐私，仅输出 error_type / code / trace_id",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z4_redact",
      "originalText": "零信任递归凭据脱敏与安全错误摘要 (observability.py)\nredact_secrets(): 递归屏蔽 key/token/secret/authorization/password/credential\n正则擦除字符串内嵌 Bearer 令牌与 DSN 连接串密码 (://user:[REDACTED]@host)\nsanitize_error_detail(): 剥离原始异常隐私，仅输出 error_type / code / trace_id",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
