      "versionNonce": 1853509389,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "生产存活与深度就绪探针 (/healthz & /readyz · api.py)\n/healthz: 零开销事件循环存活探针 -> 200 {'status': 'alive'}\n/readyz: 线程池执行 _probe_readiness (未就绪返 503 摘除流量):\n核验 DB SELECT 1、workspaces 真实写文件探针、Docker/远程沙箱与活跃 Worker 数",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z4_probes",
      "originalText": "生产存活与深度就绪探针 (/healthz & /readyz · api.py)\n/healthz: 零开销事件循环存活探针 -> 200 {'status': 'alive'}\n/readyz: 线程池执行 _probe_readiness (未就绪返 503 摘除流量):\n核验 DB SELECT 1、workspaces 真实写文件探针、Docker/远程沙箱与活跃 Worker 数",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
