      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "线程安全指标注册表与 Prometheus 导出 (MetricsRegistry)\n支持 Counter / Gauge / 累积桶 Histogram -> GET /metrics (0.0.4 文本格式)\n防御 Python isinstance(True, int) 陷阱，显式拒绝 bool 污染监控曲线\nrender_prometheus() 锁内浅拷贝快照、锁外排序拼接，高频抓取零业务阻塞!",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z4_prom",
      "originalText": "线程安全指标注册表与 Prometheus 导出 (MetricsRegistry)\n支持 Counter / Gauge / 累积桶 Histogram -> GET /metrics (0.0.4 文本格式)\n防御 Python isinstance(True, int) 陷阱，显式拒绝 bool 污染监控曲线\nrender_prometheus() 锁内浅拷贝快照、锁外排序拼接，高频抓取零业务阻塞!",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
